  "description": "IFC API x64 .NET assemblies for Revit 2017-2026 API, plus override. (If installed an override can replace the native Revit API Import/Export functions. Override source: https://github.com/Autodesk/revit-ifc/)\n\nIncludes these files:\nAutodesk.IFC.Export.UI.dll\nRevit.IFC.Common.dll\nRevit.IFC.Export.dll \nRevit.IFC.Import.Core.dll\nRevit.IFC.Import.dll\nRevitAPIIFC.dll\nRevitAPIIFC.runtimeconfig.json\nRevitAPIIFC.xml\nUserInterfaceUtility.dll\n\nDoesn't include standard main Revit API assemblies; just extra files related to IFC.\n\n(Sets the references 'Copy Local' to False -Thanks https://www.nuget.org/profiles/Bush !)",
